      "name": "Raphael",
      "created_at": "2026-01-15T14:35:24.339Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>Before upgrading to ERPNext v15, when I created a new Purchase Receipt or Manufacture Stock Entry, all items that had a Batch Number were displayed directly in the Stock Ledger Report, in the “Batch” column.</p>\n<p>Since the upgrade to v15, this is no longer the case. The Batch column is now empty, and instead I see a value in the “Serial and Batch Bundle” column with a unique reference such as SABB-000000XX.</p>\n<p>This is not helpful for my workflow. I need to see the actual batch number directly in the “Batch” column, as before. Having only a random SABB reference forces me to click on each entry to identify the linked batch, which is very time-consuming.</p>\n<p>Seeing each batch number directly in the report is essential for me and saves a lot of time.</p>\n<p>Is there a way to restore the previous behavior and display the batch number directly in the Stock Ledger Report?<br>\nI have checked Stock Settings, but I could not find any option related to this.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/a/4a5ab24959f4ac1c0836d8210cd56b6e03e8eb09.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4a5ab24959f4ac1c0836d8210cd56b6e03e8eb09\" title=\"Capture d’écran 2026-01-15 à 15.23.42\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/a/4a5ab24959f4ac1c0836d8210cd56b6e03e8eb09_2_637x500.png\" alt=\"Capture d’écran 2026-01-15 à 15.23.42\" data-base62-sha1=\"aBLEeQ8ozAvc73P5qSyvPx8II0p\" width=\"637\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/a/4a5ab24959f4ac1c0836d8210cd56b6e03e8eb09_2_637x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/a/4a5ab24959f4ac1c0836d8210cd56b6e03e8eb09_2_955x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/a/4a5ab24959f4ac1c0836d8210cd56b6e03e8eb09.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Capture d’écran 2026-01-15 à 15.23.42</span><span class=\"informations\">1123×881 80.4 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>My current Stock Setting :</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/b/ab208e6d0477d2dc4cae1c453a1bb663ddfbf1c8.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/ab208e6d0477d2dc4cae1c453a1bb663ddfbf1c8\" title=\"Capture d’écran 2026-01-15 à 15.34.14\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/b/ab208e6d0477d2dc4cae1c453a1bb663ddfbf1c8_2_690x289.png\" alt=\"Capture d’écran 2026-01-15 à 15.34.14\" data-base62-sha1=\"opRoKao0wVCHnaisg7kBKd7Dhkk\" width=\"690\" height=\"289\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/b/ab208e6d0477d2dc4cae1c453a1bb663ddfbf1c8_2_690x289.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/b/ab208e6d0477d2dc4cae1c453a1bb663ddfbf1c8_2_1035x433.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/b/ab208e6d0477d2dc4cae1c453a1bb663ddfbf1c8.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Capture d’écran 2026-01-15 à 15.34.14</span><span class=\"informations\">1315×551 65.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>My version is :</p>\n<p><strong>ERPNext:</strong> v15.64.1 (version-15)</p>\n<p><strong>Frappe Framework:</strong> v15.69.3 (version-15)</p>\n<p>Thank you in advance for your help.</p>",
